AI-POWERED E-COMMERCE ANALYTICS DASHBOARD


Table: _Measures (Dedicated Measures Table)
Dataset: amazon_sales (128,975 rows)
Currency: INR (₹)


 1. Executive Overview — KPI Card

Total Realized Revenue =
SUM(Fact_AmazonSales[Realized_Revenue])


Total Orders =
DISTINCTCOUNT(Fact_AmazonSales[Order_ID])


Cancellation Rate % =
DIVIDE(
    CALCULATE(
        COUNTROWS(Fact_AmazonSales),
        Fact_AmazonSales[Is_Cancelled] = TRUE
    ),
    COUNTROWS(Fact_AmazonSales),
    0
)